{"id": "DUWLwgtkTH-", "title": "Video by wiseelliot", "description": "In my 20s, when I had just started dating the woman who is now my wife, life didn’t look glamorous at all.\n\nThe e-commerce business I had poured everything into the one that would later become multi-million, was completely bankrupt, and I was left standing there with nothing but pressure, uncertainty, and the responsibility to fight my way back to an income from scratch.\n\nThose were dark periods. Long nights. Heavy thoughts. Moments where walking away would’ve been easier than rebuilding.\n\nAnd through all of that, she stayed. No complaints. No conditions. No fear of the struggle. She stood by my side while I rebuilt my profits, my confidence, and my future.\n\nThat’s why my loyalty to this woman isn’t a choice, it’s a principle.\nShe didn’t fall in love with the results. \n\nShe believed in the man when there were none.\nAnd a woman who stays during your hardest chapters deserves to be protected, honoured, and chosen for life.\n\n🟢♾️", "channel": "wiseelliot", "uploader_id": "49305308", "uploader": "Elliot Wise", "timestamp": 1770231182, "like_count": 16419, "comment_count": 283, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-871497855674204a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.912, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPvppKSVMERC7QZJrCgNcOcDbixJCE5NlDHsa3VdfIXJmwOYfz0U4b2fnaFZtSWBasTuxrSueREpbnUqEk6Y2oQycvOrUdvcGs5SQ8.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=wYsuM9uVcuYQ7kNvwEUOV2m&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=8nyA9nc_3NmuKL-AI